---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Worthbase"
  description="A household balance sheet your AI keeps for you — assets, debts and goals priced daily, with capital gains tracked properly."
  image="/images/projects/worthbase-og.png"
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Web App</p>
  <h1>Worthbase</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Know your wealth, watch it grow — every asset and debt in the household on
    one balance sheet, priced daily, with your AI doing the paperwork.
  </p>

  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn" href="https://worthbase.app">worthbase.app</a>
  </div>

  <section aria-labelledby="wb-features">
    <p class="eyebrow" id="wb-features">Features</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul>
        <li>Shares, ETFs, crypto, metals, property, super and loans in one ledger — across people, trusts, companies and SMSFs</li>
        <li>Holdings priced daily, with exact cost basis and Australian CGT estimates</li>
        <li>Drop in a statement — CSV, PDF or a screenshot — and AI import files it on the right accounts</li>
        <li>Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or Claude Code via MCP and run the whole thing in conversation</li>
        <li>Property equity, loan-to-value and offset accounts linked to their loans</li>
        <li>What-if simulations before you sell, goals with progress tracking, and a weekly email of what moved</li>
        <li>Full audit trail with undo</li>
        <li>No bank or broker passwords — you feed it statements, and you can export everything any time</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="more-link"><a class="quiet" href="/projects/">← All projects</a></p>
</Base>
